，甲戌，制：「諸州死罪，不得輒決，悉移大理按覆，事盡，然後上省奏裁。」","content_fanyi":"隋文帝因为天下执法官员断案多有错乱，同罪却判决不同，八月甲戌日，下达制令说：“各州死刑案件，不得擅自处决，一律移送大理寺审核复查；复查完毕后，再呈报尚书省奏请裁决。”","content_jianti_auto":"5帝以天下用律者多踳駮，罪同论异，八月，甲戌，制：「诸州死罪，不得辄决，悉移大理按覆，事尽，然后上省奏裁。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17234,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b3f653a6-db0e-11ef-a33a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6冬，十月，壬午，上享太廟。十一月，辛亥，祀南郊。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月壬午日，隋文帝祭祀太庙。十一月辛亥日，文帝在南郊祭天。","content_jianti_auto":"6冬，十月，壬午，上享太庙。十一月，辛亥，祀南郊。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17235,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b3f653aa-db0e-11ef-add5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"擒虎","people_name_jianti_auto":"擒虎","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3f653ad-db0e-11ef-8fad-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"雄","people_name_jianti_auto":"雄","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b3f653ae-db0e-11ef-bb2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"新義郡公","people_name_jianti_auto":"新义郡公","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b3f653af-db0e-11ef-924a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陳","place_name_jianti_auto":"陈","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b3f653b0-db0e-11ef-80d1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"擒虎襲父雄爵新義郡公，平陳之功，以吏議不加封爵。卒，子恤翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"擒虎袭父雄爵新义郡公，平陈之功，以吏议不加封爵。卒，子恤翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b3f653ac-db0e-11ef-87ef-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"爵位","official_name":"新義公","official_note":"新義公是隋朝授予韓擒虎的爵位，表示其封號，用於表彰功績或地位。在《資治通鑑》中，此處記錄韓擒虎去世，爵位作為其身份的一部分被提及。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"新義公韓擒虎卒","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"915a967a-6ebb-41b1-942c-762437321a96"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":538,"link_death_year":592,"link_td_description":"韩擒虎，字子通，河南郡东垣县（今河南新安县）人。隋初开国功臣之一。唐朝皇室祖先有李虎，故唐人为了避讳，时称其为韩擒。","link_td_id":"Q10001608","link_td_number_id":462331,"people_name":"新義公","people_name_jianti_auto":"新义公","people_xingming":"韩擒虎","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b3f653b1-db0e-11ef-9cd7-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":538,"link_death_year":592,"link_td_description":"韩擒虎，字子通，河南郡东垣县（今河南新安县）人。隋初开国功臣之一。唐朝皇室祖先有李虎，故唐人为了避讳，时称其为韩擒。","link_td_id":"Q10001608","link_td_number_id":462331,"people_name":"韓擒虎","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩擒虎","people_xingming":"韩擒虎","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b3f653b2-db0e-11ef-9ca1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"7己未，新義公韓擒虎卒。","content_fanyi":"己未日，新义公韩擒虎逝世。","content_jianti_auto":"7己未，新义公韩擒虎卒。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17236,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b3f653ab-db0e-11ef-afee-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"蔑，無也，視之如無也；又輕易也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"蔑，无也，视之如无也；又轻易也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"b3f6b569-db0e-11ef-8a4d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"陵，乘也，犯也，侮也，侵也。轢，陵踐也。又，車踐爲轢。轢，郞擊翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"陵，乘也，犯也，侮也，侵也。轹，陵践也。又，车践为轹。轹，郞击翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":76,"tongjian_id":"b3f6b56a-db0e-11ef-823e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"內史令","official_note":"內史令是隋朝中央官制中的高级官职，负责起草诏令和参与机要，相当于中书令。在《资治通鉴》此段中，杨素原任內史令，后被任命为尚书右仆射，反映了其官职变动。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"以內史令楊素爲尚書右僕射","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"10639c5e-1d05-4bdc-bb91-4d86c9104869"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"尚書右僕射","official_note":"尚書右僕射是隋朝尚书省的高级官员，协助尚书令处理政务，相当于副宰相。在此段中，杨素被任命为此职，与高熲共同专掌朝政，体现了其在朝廷中的核心地位。","official_rank":"从二品","source_snippet":"以內史令楊素爲尚書右僕射","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"71d694f8-8279-48a5-862e-b9a823c8fefa"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":544,"link_death_year":606,"link_td_description":"杨素，字处道，弘农郡华阴县人，出自弘农杨氏越公房，北周、隋朝军事家、诗人。","link_td_id":"Q10008547","link_td_number_id":321425,"people_name":"楊素","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨素","people_xingming":"杨素","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b3f6b56d-db0e-11ef-b609-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":607,"link_td_description":"高颎，字昭玄，一名敏，渤海郡蓨县（今河北景县）人，其父高宾为独孤信赐姓独孤氏，因此又称独孤颎，为隋朝宰相执政近20年，其子是杨勇的女婿，后因反对废太子杨勇并得罪独孤皇后，遭隋文帝猜忌，被免官为民，不久后又免去齐国公爵位。隋炀帝时，被起用为太常卿。大业三年，见炀帝奢靡，甚为忧虑，有所议论，为人告发，与贺若弼同时被杀害。诸子遭到流放。","link_td_id":"Q10001643","link_td_number_id":329611,"people_name":"高熲","people_name_jianti_auto":"高颎","people_xingming":"高熲","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b3f6b56e-db0e-11ef-bc90-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":544,"link_death_year":606,"link_td_description":"杨素，字处道，弘农郡华阴县人，出自弘农杨氏越公房，北周、隋朝军事家、诗人。","link_td_id":"Q100