_number_id":329611,"people_name":"熲","people_name_jianti_auto":"颎","people_xingming":"高熲","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df0c-db0e-11ef-8a3f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b3f6b567-db0e-11ef-a6e6-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"lì","source_anchor_text":"貴多被陵轢其才藝風","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":74,"text":"轢","tongjian_id":"2b09f801-d5b3-5a4a-a527-9d2a7e927ed4"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"8十二月，乙酉，以內史令楊素爲尚書右僕射，與高熲專掌朝政。素性疏辯，高下在心，朝臣之內，頗推高熲，敬牛弘，厚接薛道衡，視蘇威蔑如也，自餘朝貴，多被陵轢。其才藝風調優於熲；至於推誠體國，處物平當，有宰相識度，不如熲遠矣。","content_fanyi":"十二月乙酉日，任命内史令杨素为尚书右仆射，与尚书左仆射高颎共同专掌朝廷政事。杨素生性疏略而长于辩才，评判人物高低全凭自己心意，在朝臣之中，他颇推崇高颎，敬重太常卿牛弘，厚意结交薛道衡，却把苏威看得很轻，其余朝中权贵大多遭受他的欺凌。他的才艺和风度优于高颎；至于以诚心体念国事、处事公正允当、具备宰相的见识与器度，则远不如高颎。","content_jianti_auto":"8十二月，乙酉，以内史令杨素为尚书右仆射，与高颎专掌朝政。素性疏辩，高下在心，朝臣之内，颇推高颎，敬牛弘，厚接薛道衡，视苏威蔑如也，自余朝贵，多被陵轹。其才艺风调优于颎；至于推诚体国，处物平当，有宰相识度，不如颎远矣。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17237,"number":8,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b3f6b567-db0e-11ef-a6e6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"昌言，明言於廣衆。啗，徒濫翻，又徒覽翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"昌言，明言于广众。啗，徒滥翻，又徒览翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":102,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df0f-db0e-11ef-a3d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"低，降意也。回，轉心也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"低，降意也。回，转心也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":243,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df11-db0e-11ef-90c3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"右領軍大將軍","official_note":"右領軍大將軍是隋朝禁軍高級將領，掌管右領軍府，負責宮廷和京師的防衛。在原文中，賀若弼擔任此職，顯示其軍事地位，但後來因不滿未被任命為宰相而被免官。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"右領軍大將軍賀若弼","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"dc5a0c9d-ec67-4deb-bca7-e87bb4db499a"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"宰相","official_note":"宰相是古代中國最高行政長官，總理朝政。在原文中，賀若弼自比宰相，表達其對權力的渴望，但實際未被任命，導致不滿。","official_rank":"正一品或從一品","source_snippet":"每以宰相自許","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"6af0e26f-1639-4fb8-a2b8-c9e9c38217b8"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"僕射","official_note":"僕射是隋朝尚書省的長官，相當於副宰相，協助皇帝處理政務。在原文中，楊素被任命為僕射，這激發了賀若弼的嫉妒和不平。","official_rank":"從二品","source_snippet":"楊素爲僕射","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"35efb2aa-d376-45df-bb11-bf8aca6d4c34"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"將軍","official_note":"將軍是泛指軍事將領的職務，在原文中，賀若弼仍擔任將軍職位，但具體官名未指明，可能指其原有軍職。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"弼仍爲將軍","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"d11cbd16-8404-4ddc-8502-48249d4deb22"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"公卿","official_note":"公卿是對高級官員的泛稱，包括三公九卿等，在原文中，公卿上奏賀若弼的罪行，顯示其集體決策角色。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"公卿奏弼怨望","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"5b01cc01-2761-4ea7-964b-65f82c7bb2f4"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":544,"link_death_year":607,"link_td_description":"贺若弼，复姓贺若，字辅伯，河南郡洛阳县人。隋朝大臣，一说为古琴曲《良宵引》的作者。","link_td_id":"Q10001386","link_td_number_id":341663,"people_name":"賀若弼","people_name_jianti_auto":"贺若弼","people_xingming":"贺若弼","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df13-db0e-11ef-ad5f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":544,"link_death_year":606,"link_td_description":"杨素，字处道，弘农郡华阴县人，出自弘农杨氏越公房，北周、隋朝军事家、诗人。","link_td_id":"Q10008547","link_td_number_id":321425,"people_name":"楊素"