tities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","权争"],"content":"右領軍大將軍賀若弼，自謂功名出朝臣之右，每以宰相自許。旣而楊素爲僕射，弼仍爲將軍，甚不平，形於言色，由是坐免官，怨望愈甚。久之，上下弼獄，謂之曰：「我以高熲、楊素爲宰相，汝每昌言曰：『此二人惟堪啗飯耳。』是何意也？」弼曰：「熲，臣之故人；素，臣舅子：臣並知其爲人，誠有此語。」公卿奏弼怨望，罪當死。上曰：「臣下守法不移，公可自求活理。」弼曰：「臣恃至尊威靈，將八千兵渡江，擒陳叔寶，竊以此望活。」上曰：「此已格外重賞，何用追論！」弼曰：「臣已蒙格外重賞，今還格外望活。」旣而上低回數日，惜其功，特令除名。歲餘，復其爵位，上亦忌之，不復任使，然每宴賜，遇之甚厚。","content_fanyi":"右领军大将军贺若弼，自认为功名在朝臣之上，常以宰相自许。不久杨素担任尚书右仆射，贺若弼仍是将军，心中极为不平，并在言谈神色间流露出来，因此获罪被免官，怨恨愈发加深。过了很久，文帝将贺若弼下狱，问他说：“我任用高颎、杨素为宰相，你常常公开扬言：‘这两个人只配吃饭罢了。’这是什么意思？”贺若弼说：“高颎是臣的旧友；杨素是臣舅父之子：臣了解他们的为人，确实说过这话。”公卿上奏贺若弼心怀怨恨，论罪应当处死。文帝说：“臣下守法坚执不移，你可以自己寻求活命的理由。”贺若弼说：“臣仗恃陛下的威灵，统率八千士兵渡过长江，擒获陈叔宝，私下想凭此请求活命。”文帝说：“这已经给予过格外重赏，何必再追论！”贺若弼说：“臣已蒙受格外重赏，如今还希望格外开恩活命。”随后文帝犹豫了好几天，怜惜他的功劳，特令将他除名。过了一年多，恢复了他的爵位，文帝也对他有所猜忌，不再任用差遣，但每逢宴饮赏赐，待他仍十分优厚。","content_jianti_auto":"右领军大将军贺若弼，自谓功名出朝臣之右，每以宰相自许。既而杨素为仆射，弼仍为将军，甚不平，形于言色，由是坐免官，怨望愈甚。久之，上下弼狱，谓之曰：「我以高颎、杨素为宰相，汝每昌言曰：『此二人惟堪啗饭耳。』是何意也？」弼曰：「颎，臣之故人；素，臣舅子：臣并知其为人，诚有此语。」公卿奏弼怨望，罪当死。上曰：「臣下守法不移，公可自求活理。」弼曰：「臣恃至尊威灵，将八千兵渡江，擒陈叔宝，窃以此望活。」上曰：「此已格外重赏，何用追论！」弼曰：「臣已蒙格外重赏，今还格外望活。」既而上低回数日，惜其功，特令除名。岁余，复其爵位，上亦忌之，不复任使，然每宴赐，遇之甚厚。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，颎除名，德林终废。徒于杨素投胶漆之分，举天下以托之，何...","context_before":"...旋及。至于贺若弼、高颎、李德林倚为心膂，不在杨素之下，而","source_end_index":108,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"86d143d2-f904-4af6-b82b-4670d3eeb4f1","source_start_index":103,"source_text":"弼下吏几死"}],"title":"一三 杨素杀人为事与文帝惨毒相合"}],"id":17238,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df0d-db0e-11ef-9b36-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"陳","place_name_jianti_auto":"陈","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df25-db0e-11ef-a1be-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂賞平陳將士。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓赏平陈将士。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df24-db0e-11ef-b7fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爾，猶言如此。","note_content_jianti_auto":"尔，犹言如此。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df26-db0e-11ef-9a24-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df28-db0e-11ef-b416-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df29-db0e-11ef-9107-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df2a-db0e-11ef-934e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢官有中藏令，晉有中、黃、左、右藏令，隋初有右藏、黃藏令，至是始闢左藏院。藏，徂浪翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉官有中藏令，晋有中、黄、左、右藏令，隋初有右藏、黄藏令，至是始辟左藏院。藏，徂浪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df27-db0e-11ef-9667-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"back_reference","source_end_index":12,"source_start_index":8,"source_text":"詳已見前","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b22397b4-db0e-11ef-9739-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"田出租，丁出調，詳已見前。兵受田，計畝爲功，以其所出，脩器械，備糗糧，今亦減其半。調，徒弔翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"田出租，丁出调，详已见前。兵受田，计亩为功，以其所出，修器械，备糗粮，今亦减其半。调，徒吊翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df2b-db0e-11ef-b904-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"京辅","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df2d-db0e-11ef-ba03-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"關","place_name_jianti_auto":"关","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df2e-db0e-11ef-aa6e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"三河","place_name_jianti_auto":"三河","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df2f-db0e-11ef-8612-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df30-db0e-11ef-a114-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河南","place_name_jianti_auto":"河南","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df31-db0e-11ef-83a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河北","place_name_jianti_auto":"河北","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df32-db0e-11ef-abe0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"京輔，謂關內。三河，謂河東、河南、河北。少，與小同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"京辅，谓关内。三河，谓河东、河南、河北。少，与小同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df2c-db0e-11ef-8814-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河北","place_name_jianti_auto":"河北","resolved_place_entity_id":58,"start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df34-db0e-11ef-bc1e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","resolved_place_entity_id":105,"start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df35-db0e-11ef-87e0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"京辅","resolved_place_entity_id":3564,"start_index":132,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df36-db0e-11ef-978f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"三河","place_name_jianti_auto":"三河","resolved_place_entity_id":1982,"start_index":135,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df37-db0e-11ef-bb22-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"9有司上言：「府藏皆滿，無所容，積於廊廡。」帝曰：「朕旣薄賦於民，又大經賜用，何得爾也？」對曰：「入者常多於出，洛計每年賜用，至數百萬段，曾無減損。」於是更闢左藏院以受之。詔曰：「寧積於人，無藏府庫。河北、河東今年田租三分減一，兵減半功，謂全免。」時天下戶口歲增，京輔及三河地少而人衆，衣食不給，帝乃發使四出，均天下之田，其狹鄕每丁纔至二十畝，老少又少焉。","content_fanyi":"有关官吏上奏说：“府库都已装满，没有地方再容纳，财物只得堆积在堂前廊屋里。”隋文帝说：“朕已经对百姓减轻赋税，又曾大量赏赐平陈的有功将士并支付各种用度，为什么还会这样呢？”回答说：“收入总是多于支出，大致计算每年用于赏赐和日常支用，多达数百万段，府库中的财物从来没有减少。”于是文帝另外开辟左藏院来接纳这些财物。文帝下诏说：“宁可让财物积存在百姓那里，也不要藏在官府仓库里。河北、河东今年的田租减征三分之一，兵役减半，功调全部免除。”当时全国户口年年增加，京辅和三河一带地少人多，百姓衣食不足，文帝于是分派使者前往各地，均分天下田地，地少人多的狭乡里，每个成年男丁仅能分到二十亩，老人和小孩分到的还要更少。","content_jianti_auto":"9有司上言：「府藏皆满，无所容，积于廊庑。」帝曰：「朕既薄赋于民，又大经赐用，何得尔也？」对曰：「入者常多于出，洛计每年赐用，至数百万段，曾无减损。」于是更辟左藏院以受之。诏曰：「宁积于人，无藏府库。河北、河东今年田租三分减一，兵减半功，谓全免。」时天下户口岁增，京辅及三河地少而人众，衣食不给，帝乃发使四出，均天下之田，其狭鄕每丁才至二十亩，老少又少焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，狭乡十亩而籍一户，其虐民可知矣，则为均田之说者，王者所...","context_before":"...、景得此道也，故天下安而汉祚以长。隋之速亡也，不亦宜乎！","source_end_index":143,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"740f678b-ab95-4f88-82f2-3afc77be8f8f","source_start_index":139,"source_text":"均田令行"}],"title":"一一 隋均田乃虐民之政"}],"id":17239,"number":9,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b3f6df21-db0e-11ef-8559-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"開皇十二年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"开皇十二年","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3f48b17-db0e-11ef-aa7e-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（壬子、五九二）","year_int":592},"message":"success","success":true}